    "rating": 4.6,
    "reference": "ChIJhXdxc_1IyUwRKmHBVX31wOU",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "P Bouwman",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103282325692121293275/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJCZytjpW6P2Qa958W5f3ORM9l7o8VbV5ismGIT1a7IH-rNqA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "At the recommendation of my plumber i used Lesage to completely replace my French drain. Anyone who has had to replace their French drain knows this is an expensive and stressful experience but Lesage was awesome! Lesage offered a longer guarantee, were able to remove my balcony as part of the contract as well as not having to remove my heat pump. I mention this because other companies I had come to give estimates gave me about the same price but I would have to dismantle or destroy my balcony myself, uproot my bushes myself and have a company come and temporarily remove my heat pump all at my own extra cost. So with referrals for Lesage plus less cost and pre-work to do I absolutely went with Lesage, and I am glad I did. The workers who replaced my French drain did it all in a week and were so professional and good at their job that I had Neighbors who were watching ask me for Lesage’s contact info should they ever have to do similar jobs. It has been a few years since the work was completed and I have not had a drop of water come into my home due to the French drain. I truly recommend Lesage for any foundation work that you may have. If something in my foundation required repairing, replacing etc I would without hesitation use Lesage again. Thank you for the excellent work that you did to my home.",
        "time": 1758896550,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Karen Bright",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109704157104352345219/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUn6xofdJUD4bPkCASFbzSGIiE6iJnKc0CuRiY64IZ_wvDn2H98Pw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Extremely professional and very easy to work with.  They explained the work that needed to be done, and quoted very precisely.  I dealt with many members of their team and every one was polite and pleasant to deal with.  They communicated very effectively throughout the entire process.  I was very pleased with the work that they did.",
        "time": 1732736544,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Vittoria Lipari",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104562641499864378587/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXNUeVlRnnL63L6xQBEA5TIrDrQ0XtgaNtyIph4bpiNaS6ffm0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "They did good work on the foundation but that’s where the positives points end unfortunately. The whole project was highly disorganized and communication with me was extremely poor. I could tell that they were juggling many projects inefficiently at once. Firstly they lied multiple times about the start date and I had to chase them to get information. Secondly, when they started exposing the foundation they stopped the work to tell me one thing, only to finish the excavation to realize that we had to change the plan again. They waited many days between starting and stopping the work, likely to work on another site instead of finishing what they started. Lastly, they did not complete the backfill, saying somehow it was not included in the estimate, took my money, and then ignored me. If you want to spend a lot of money to have terrible service but a protected foundation, then choose this company.",
        "time": 1732858397,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Soraya Desmangles",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101982797401288119781/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWv1gwE5WEbeFJdZzanBFjqVE_s_vSdULMziKNOK9wfczyB-0go=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Courteous, professional, hard workers, the kids (they say hi) enjoyed watching them work too! Replacing French drains makes a mess but they did everything possible to minimize and clean up. Would recommend (a lot of my neighbors asked for their business card or took their info).\nThank you for a job well done 👍",
        "time": 1600696289,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "rigonom",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115428313468895966679/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJEv_lgjYmk_5RluHZ1ky8wM4J3FDaih5tkIK4nbIDLDxeUhQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 years ago",
        "text": "I got about 5 quotes when it was time to install my French drain. Lesage had the most modern techniques and the best warranty. Still pretty expensive but worth the extra money for the 20year warranty compaired to the 10 year with some of the cheaper guys. Joe and Antoine were very professional, punctual and knowledgeable. It's comforting to know that when you are spending a lot of money on a big job that it is being properly .\nMerci Lesage Excavation",
        "time": 1494632722,
        "translated": false
      }
